CREATED:20260511T191822Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>This interactive session will discuss how disability shows 
 up in the workplace and how we can ensure that everyone in our community 
 is supported in their work. Participants will be invited to explore disab
 ility as a form of human difference that touches all of our lives. We wil
 l discuss disability history\, physical disability\, neurodiversity\, inc
 reasing access\, and more. Participants will engage activities to deepen 
 their knowledge about disability\, and their capacity to cultivate an abi
 lity inclusive workforce\n    \nFacilitated by: <strong>Elizabeth Jones\,
  Ph.D.</strong>\, Director for Education and Outreach\n\n        <strong>
 Tuesday\, August 4\, 2026 | 10:00 AM - 12:00 PM | </strong><a href="https
 ://duke.zoom.us/meeting/register/tg4_TMgNQ3erHxp8-41c1g"><strong>REGISTER
  HERE (Zoom)</strong></a>\n</p>
DURATION:PT2H
